s to be to interact with or kick the ball.\n\n    Ball Reach: Allows you to magically kick or take possession of the ball from a distance without physically touching it. It works by forcing the game's internal ball-contact logic to trigger whenever a ball enters your radius.\n\n    Reach Radius: A slider that lets you adjust exactly how far your \"Ball Reach\" extends (adjustable from 3 to 40 studs).\n\n    Show Reach: A visual aid that creates a transparent colored bubble around your character, showing you the exact size and hit-area of your current reach radius.\n\n🥅 SHOOTING\n\nThese features manipulate the game's shot mechanics, modifying charge times and kick physics.\n\n    Full Charge: Instantly charges your kicks to 100% maximum power the moment you shoot, bypassing the normal wind-up/charge time.\n\n    Insane Power: A toggle that overrides the game's default shot limits, allowing you to hit the ball with custom force and angles.\n\n    Power (Slider): Used in combination with \"Insane Power\", this lets you multiply the physical force of your kicks by up to 10x.\n\n    Height (Slider): Used in combination with \"Insane Power\", this lets you multiply the vertical angle/height of your kicks by up to 6x.\n\n🏃‍♂️ PLAYER\n\n    Infinite Stamina: Completely stops your character's stamina from draining while running by overriding the game's internal stamina drain rate to zero.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/04Jordn/SUMMIT/refs/heads/main/FutGame\"))();","owner":{"_id":"6a50194009d0b5c78488a61a","username":"04Jordn","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6a50194009d0b5c78488a61a-1784253161959.png","status":"offline","id":"6a50194009d0b5c78488a61a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"views":468,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/88033955914813-1784472433375.png","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdA